---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import LocalBusinessSchema from "../components/LocalBusinessSchema.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Materuni Camping | Overnight Village Camping in Kilimanjaro" description="Experience Materuni camping with local hosts. Stay overnight in Materuni Village near Moshi, enjoy Chagga culture, local food and the Kilimanjaro foothills.">
<LocalBusinessSchema />
<main class="landing">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">OVERNIGHT VILLAGE EXPERIENCE · MATERUNI, TANZANIA</p><h1>Materuni Camping with Local Hosts</h1><p>Make time for more than a quick stop. Spend a night in Materuni Village, discover Chagga traditions, enjoy local food and slow down beneath the green slopes of Mount Kilimanjaro.</p><a class="button" href="/booking?source=materuni-camping&experience=Camping%20%26%20Village%20Life">Check camping availability</a></div><img class="camping-landing-photo" src="https://sskmzswoeljxwojcszta.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/materuni-images/story_image/1791994219885-materuni-coffe-plantatio-tour.jpg" alt="Green coffee-growing landscape in Materuni Village" width="1200" height="850" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></section>
<section><h2>What to expect from Materuni camping</h2><p>Materuni Hosts offers an overnight camping experience centred on village life and time with local hosts. Depending on your confirmed arrangement, your stay can bring together camping, a waterfall walk, Chagga coffee traditions, local food and an evening around camp.</p><ul><li>One-night village camping experience</li><li>Time to explore Materuni and its forest paths</li><li>Chagga coffee and food traditions</li><li>Local hosting and campfire time</li></ul><p>Camping equipment, bedding, toilet and shower access, meals and other practical details should be confirmed with your host for your travel dates before payment.</p></section>
<section><h2>Why stay overnight in Materuni?</h2><p>An overnight visit gives you more time to experience the village at a relaxed pace instead of fitting everything into a short day trip. It can also make room for both the waterfall trail and cultural activities.</p><a class="text-link" href="/accommodation">Read about accommodation in Materuni</a></section>
<section><h2>Plan your Materuni camping stay</h2><p>Send your preferred date, group size and any questions. A local host will check availability and confirm the arrangements before you make payment.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/booking?source=materuni-camping&experience=Camping%20%26%20Village%20Life">Request a camping date</a><a class="text-link" href="/camping">View the full camping experience</a></div></section>
<section><h2>Explore more of Materuni</h2><p><a href="/materuni-waterfall-tour">Materuni Waterfall Tour</a> · <a href="/day-trips">Materuni day trips</a> · <a href="/itinerary">Build your Materuni itinerary</a></p></section>
</main>
<style>
.landing{color:#242421}.landing .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(280px,.95fr);gap:clamp(24px,5vw,64px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(42px,7vw,88px) clamp(22px,8vw,110px);background:#1a3322;color:#faf7f2}.landing .camping-landing-photo{display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(280px,36vw,480px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 18px 42px #0003}.landing .hero h1{max-width:850px;margin:12px 0;font:600 clamp(42px,7vw,76px)/1.02 "Cormorant Garamond",serif;color:#faf7f2}.landing .hero p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:700px;color:#e6dfd3;line-height:1.85}.landing .hero-copy{max-width:760px}.eyebrow{color:#c5a059;font:800 11px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.16em}.landing section:not(.hero){max-width:950px;margin:auto;padding:42px 24px}.landing h2{font:600 clamp(30px,4vw,44px)/1.1 "Cormorant Garamond",serif;color:#1a3322}.landing p,.landing li{line-height:1.85;color:#586258}.landing li{margin:.4rem 0}.button{display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#c5a059;color:#1a3322;text-decoration:none;font:800 13px Manrope,sans-serif}.text-link{color:#1a3322;font-weight:800}.actions{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}@media(max-width:760px){.landing .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:42px 22px}.landing .camping-landing-photo{height:260px;grid-row:1}.landing .hero-copy{grid-row:2}}
</style>
</SiteLayout>
